<!ELEMENT Property ((DefaultValue)?, (LowerBound)?, (UpperBound)?, (ExcludeValue)?, (FieldDefn | MatrixDefn | TableDefn)?, (ReferenceFilterClass)*)>
<!ATTLIST Property
